{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんおはようございます！\n新内眞衣です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回レインブーツの記事を書いた途端\n雨ばかりの日々で驚きを隠せません(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨女なのかな、私、、、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！\n最近のOL生活はというと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人事異動が本格化してきて、\n大量のお花が社内に溢れています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前を向いても胡蝶蘭。\n後ろを向いても胡蝶蘭。\n胡蝶蘭と共に仕事をしているのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく優雅な気持ちになります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、社会人の方はご存知かと\n思いますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胡蝶蘭は花言葉が\n【幸福の飛来・到来】という意味があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花として生命力が強く、\n2ヶ月以上綺麗な花を咲かせます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更に鉢植えの花なので「根付く」\nという意味も込められ、\n長くその地に根付き、\n幸福がやってきますように\nという意味が込められているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくこういった時に贈られるみたいですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(上司に教えて貰いました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと2カ月もお花に囲まれて\n生活出来るなんて幸せ〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月も頑張りましょう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Samurai ELO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Samurai ELO発売中です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃん家に帰ってきて\nぐーたらしたり花火したり\nというテーマで\n撮って頂きました(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年初の手持ち花火〜〜！\n夏だな〜〜なんて言いながら\n撮影してたよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに\nこのときの撮影場所が\n母校から割りと近いところだったので、\n母校に少し寄ってきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お世話になった先生には会えなかった\nけど、何人かの先生は覚えてくれていて\n嬉しかったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会があったら行きたいな〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月23日までです！\nよろしくお願いします(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎毎週水曜日24:00〜 bayFM\nまいちゅんカフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"mytune@bayfm.co.jp\nメールも良かったら送ってみて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/10 毎週金曜24:12〜 テレビ東京\n『初森ベマーズ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も何回か出ますよ♪\n事前にまたお知らせしますね！\nお楽しみに〜〜(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/11 23:15〜 NHK BSプレミアム\n『乃木坂46 SHOW！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈々未さんとショートコント\nやってるので是非見て下さい！\n太陽ノックもフルバージョンです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎7/13 毎週月曜25:29〜 日本テレビ\n『NOGIBINGO!5』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに、シーズン5がスタートします♪\n夜遅いですが、無理しない程度に\n見てくれたら嬉しいです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このほかにも、\n最近は嬉しい撮影があったり\n歌番組とか、刺激的な毎日で\n楽しんでます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏は乃木坂46を見る機会が\nたくさんあると思うので、\n皆さんに楽しんで頂けるよう\n頑張ります〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬さん！こないだ楽屋の席がお隣で\nたくさんお話し出来て楽しかった〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのことも知れて嬉しかったな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/07/09/9850526/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんとの俺のフレンチ\n行けてなくて申し訳ない（ ;  ; ）\n早く行こう！夢の国も早く行きたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nまとまりませんが\n今日はこの辺で♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます〜〜(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"ty